# JSON Web Token Provider

The `jwt` provider lets you generate JSON Web Tokens (JWTs) from
within your Terraform or OpenTofu configuration. It supports
HMAC-signed tokens (`HS256`, `HS384`, `HS512`) and asymmetric
signatures (`RS256/384/512`, `ES256/384/512`).

The provider has no remote state or external API: token generation
happens locally during `terraform apply`, and the resulting token is
stored in state as a sensitive computed attribute.

